qca-mcs: observe membership without replacing Linux forwarding

Keep the software bridge working while ECM learns destination interfaces.
Bound the netlink payload and flood/encapsulation copies.

--- a/mc_forward.c
+++ b/mc_forward.c
@@ -14,6 +14,9 @@
  */
 
